WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:06.840
In 1999, a daringly original sci-fi film became
the must-see hit of the year and launched

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.460
one of the most successful trilogies of all
time.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.400
The Matrix.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.060
Now, two decades later, another sequel is
on the way.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.020
So grab a spoon, pick a pill, and find out
everything there is to know about The Matrix

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:19.520
4.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.020
"All I'm offering you is the truth.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.080
Nothing more."

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:31.080
Though no release date has yet been revealed,
we have some pretty good guesses.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.260
Variety reported that the new Matrix film
is scheduled to begin filming in early 2020.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:40.900
Considering how long it takes to film, edit,
and create digital effects for a movie like

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:45.880
The Matrix, the release date likely won't
be until the summer or fall of 2021.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.120
That would be in keeping with tradition.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:55.040
The Matrix and The Matrix Reloaded hit theaters
in late March 1999 and mid-May 2003, respectively,

00:00:55.410 --> 00:01:00.260
while The Matrix Revolutions, shot immediately
after Reloaded, made its way to theaters just

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:06.020
six months later in November 2003 so as to
not keep fans waiting for the trilogy's conclusion.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:12.440
Keanu Reeves, actor, officially became Keanu
Reeves, legend, thanks to his turn as Neo

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.340
in The Matrix.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.240
For most fans, if there's no Neo, there's
no point to a new Matrix film.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:21.700
Well, don't worry, because Reeves is reportedly
signed on for The Matrix 4.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.040
And he'll also be joined by co-star Carrie
Anne-Moss, who became a Hollywood sensation

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:26.640
as Trinity.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:31.350
So far, though, there's no word regarding
the return of other Matrix stars like Hugo

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:33.900
Weaving, Laurence Fishburne, or Jada-Pinkett-Smith.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.120
For now, we'll just have to wait and see.

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:40.420
It wouldn't be a Matrix movie if the Wachowskis
weren't involved.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:46.180
After turning heads with the stylish 1996
crime drama Bound, Lana and Lily Wachowski

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:51.370
made themselves legends with The Matrix in
1999, and went on to co-write and co-direct

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:52.560
the entire trilogy.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:54.980
So will they be involved with the new Matrix?

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.200
For now, the answer is yes… and no.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:03.500
While Lily Wachowski apparently won't be involved,
Lana Wachowski is set to direct, and co-write

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.939
the script with author Aleksander Hemon and
Cloud Atlas screenwriter David Mitchell.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:08.939
Warner Bros.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.020
Picture Group head Toby Emmerich said,

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:14.860
"We could not be more excited to be re-entering
The Matrix with Lana.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:20.400
Lana is a true visionary - a singular and
original creative filmmaker - and we are thrilled

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.320
that she is writing, directing, and producing
this new chapter in The Matrix universe."

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:30.580
One thing conspicuously absent from Variety's
August 2019 report announcing the launch of

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.640
The Matrix 4 was any mention of Laurence Fishburne's
character Morpheus.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:40.280
Variety reporter Justin Kroll later tweeted
that this may actually be a hint as to the

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:42.140
plot of the film, writing,

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:47.260
"If you've asked yourself, 'Where's [Morpheus],'
sources have told me this may point to where

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:52.300
and when the film is set as I've heard execs
are looking at a variety of actors to possibly

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.660
play 'young [Morpheus].'

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.440
Stay tuned on that front…"

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.620
The fact that Morpheus might be played by
an actor younger than Fishburne suggests The

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:06.420
Matrix 4 takes place in a different time - or
in a different timeline - than the original

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:06.920
trilogy.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:12.640
And it also suggests they've decided to scrap
the previously rumored Matrix reboot as well.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:18.900
Yes it's true: back in March, 2017, The Hollywood
Reporter broke the news that Warner Bros.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:23.560
had started preliminary development of a reboot/relaunch
of The Matrix.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:28.740
After original Matrix producer Joel Silver
approached Warner Bros. with the idea of a

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:33.380
revival, the studio reportedly began discussions
with X-Men: The Last Stand and Incredible

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:37.040
Hulk screenwriter Zak Penn to write a detailed
narrative plot outline.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:42.440
The Wachowskis were not involved with that
project, and no actors were ever signed, but

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:47.879
initial reports hinted that Warner Bros. would've
liked to cast Creed star Michael B. Jordan.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:52.880
Now, though, with director Lana Wachowski
and stars Keanu Reeves and Carrie Anne-Moss

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:57.599
all set to return to the world of The Matrix,
it seems as though that reboot project is

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.120
dead - killed off by the original.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:02.580
"Ironically, this is not far from the truth.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.180
Do you believe in fate?"

